455
00:43:44,811 --> 00:43:53,811
あきらめも苦しみも重なっていく ここらとき、あなたと
Let's stack up our resignation and suffering too, with you...

456
00:43:55,311 --> 00:44:04,811
夢を歌おう魔法に乗せて 何度も立ち上がるきみと一緒に進んでく
Let's sing our dreams, carried by magic, advancing forward together with you!

457
00:44:05,811 --> 00:44:15,811
夢は夢は終わらない 未来をとり戻すんだ
Dreams will never end. We will take back our future!

458
00:44:15,811 --> 00:44:25,811
なんのって笑って もう一歩一歩歩き始めよう
Laughing no matter what, let's take another step forward once more!

459
00:44:25,811 --> 00:44:36,811
ホロウィッチおやさい 夢の先へ
HoloWitch, onwards to the future of our dreams!

460
00:44:42,811 --> 00:44:53,811
ワクワクするような 日々と夢の結晶 思い出して魔法を唱えてみたら
Days that make you excited and the crystallization of your dreams—if you remember them and chant a magic spell...

461
00:44:53,811 --> 00:44:59,811
ドキドキするような きみの物語 何度でも……
Your heart-pounding story, over and over again...

462
00:45:01,469 --> 00:45:03,519
光り…光りだすんだよ
Light... it starts to shine!

463
00:45:04,319 --> 00:45:07,269
頑張ってたってても…
No matter how hard I try...

464
00:45:07,269 --> 00:45:11,669
もううまくいかない日の方が多く感じちゃったりするよね
It feels like there are more days that don't go my way.

465
00:45:15,619 --> 00:45:18,319
かなえよう、不安も
Let's grant our wishes, even the anxieties,

466
00:45:18,319 --> 00:45:21,119
悲しみも語れないぜ
and the sorrows we can't speak of.

467
00:45:21,119 --> 00:45:25,119
一人じゃない
We are not alone.

468
00:45:26,219 --> 00:45:29,919
希望の種を
The seeds of hope...

469
00:45:29,919 --> 00:45:37,119
汗に泣いたら一番に輝く綺麗な花が咲くよ
If we cry through our sweat, the brightest, most beautiful flower will bloom.

470
00:45:38,319 --> 00:45:41,619
夢を歌おうよ
Let's sing of our dreams,

471
00:45:41,619 --> 00:45:47,969
魔法に乗っけて何度も立ち上がる君と一緒に進んでく
riding on magic, getting back up again and again, moving forward together with you!

472
00:45:49,119 --> 00:45:54,119
夢は夢は涙を流さない
Dreams, dreams don't shed tears,

473
00:45:54,119 --> 00:45:59,919
未来をどこまでも行こう
Let's go to the future no matter where!

474
00:46:00,119 --> 00:46:04,619
何度だって笑ってもう一回行こう
Laugh no matter what, and let's go once more!

475
00:46:04,619 --> 00:46:11,319
歩き始めようホロウィッチを飛ばそう夢の先へ
Let's start walking, making HoloWitch soar toward the edge of our dreams!

